<!doctype html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
<title>Analizar producto — ECI Suite</title>
<style>
  :root {
    color-scheme: dark;
    --bg: #0a0e18; --bg-soft: #0d1322; --surface: #111a2e; --surface-2: #0e1626;
    --border: rgba(255,255,255,.08); --border-strong: rgba(255,255,255,.16);
    --text: #e7ecf7; --muted: #8b92a8; --muted-2: #5f6780;
    --accent: #2dd4ee; --accent-soft: rgba(45,212,238,.12);
    --gold: #eaa63e; --danger: #f27272; --danger-bg: rgba(242,114,114,.14);
    --tag-bg: rgba(255,255,255,.05);
    --shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(0,0,0,.35);
  }
  * { box-sizing: border-box; }
  body { font-family: -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif; margin: 0; background: var(--bg); color: var(--text); line-height: 1.5; }
  a { color: var(--accent); }

  .topbar { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: .8rem; padding: 1rem 1.6rem; background: var(--bg-soft); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); }
  .logo { width: 40px; height: 40px; border-radius: 10px; flex: none; background: radial-gradient(circle at 30% 30%, var(--gold), #7a4e12); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 1.3rem; box-shadow: 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,255,255,.08), 0 4px 12px rgba(234,166,62,.25); }
  .brand-name { font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.05rem; letter-spacing: -.01em; }
  .brand-sub { color: var(--muted); font-size: .78rem; }
  .topbar a.back { margin-left: auto; font-size: .85rem; color: var(--muted); }

  main { max-width: 640px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 2.2rem 1.6rem 4rem; }
  h1 { font-size: 1.6rem; margin: 0 0 .4rem; }
  .subtitle { color: var(--muted); font-size: .92rem; margin: 0 0 1.6rem; }

  .error-box { background: var(--danger-bg); border: 1px solid rgba(242,114,114,.35); color: #ffd6d6; border-radius: 10px; padding: .8rem 1rem; margin-bottom: 1.2rem; font-size: .88rem; }

  form { background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 16px; padding: 1.6rem; box-shadow: var(--shadow); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1.1rem; }
  label { display: block; font-size: .82rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--tag-text, #b7bed2); margin-bottom: .35rem; }
  .hint { font-size: .76rem; color: var(--muted-2); margin-top: .3rem; }
  select, textarea, input[type=text], input[type=number] {
    width: 100%; background: var(--surface-2); border: 1px solid var(--border-strong); color: var(--text);
    border-radius: 8px; padding: .6rem .7rem; font-size: .92rem; font-family: inherit;
  }
  select:focus, textarea:focus, input:focus { outline: 2px solid var(--accent); outline-offset: 1px; }
  textarea { resize: vertical; min-height: 90px; }
  .row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 1rem; }
  .row-3 { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr; gap: 1rem; }
  .checkbox-group { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: .6rem; }
  .checkbox-group label { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: .4rem; font-weight: 500; font-size: .85rem; background: var(--tag-bg); padding: .4rem .7rem; border-radius: 8px; margin: 0; cursor: pointer; }
  .checkbox-group input { width: auto; }
  button[type=submit] {
    background: var(--gold); color: #201400; font-weight: 700; border: none; border-radius: 10px;
    padding: .8rem 1.2rem; font-size: .95rem; cursor: pointer; margin-top: .4rem;
  }
  button[type=submit]:hover { filter: brightness(1.05); }
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header class="topbar">
  <div class="logo">📡</div>
  <div>
    <div class="brand-name">ECI Suite</div>
    <div class="brand-sub">Análisis de Viabilidad de Producto</div>
  </div>
  <a class="back" href="/">← Panel de mercado</a>
</header>

<main>
  <h1>¿Vale la pena vender este producto?</h1>
  <p class="subtitle">Describí el producto y te decimos cuántos competidores reales hay, a qué precio están vendiendo, y si tu margen aguanta.</p>

  {% if error %}
  <div class="error-box">⚠️ {{ error }}</div>
  {% endif %}

  <form method="post" action="/producto">
    <div>
      <label for="niche">Nicho</label>
      <select name="niche" id="niche" required>
        {% for n in niches %}
        <option value="{{ n.code }}" {{ 'selected' if n.code == selected_niche else '' }}>{{ n.label }}</option>
        {% endfor %}
      </select>
    </div>

    <div>
      <label for="product">Descripción del producto</label>
      <textarea name="product" id="product" required placeholder="Ej: chaqueta rompevientos unisex, tela impermeable, varios colores">{{ form_values.product if form_values else '' }}</textarea>
      <p class="hint">Mientras más específica, mejor detecta el subnicho (tipo de producto, material, para quién es).</p>
    </div>

    <div>
      <label>Mercados a considerar</label>
      <div class="checkbox-group">
        {% for m in available_markets %}
        <label><input type="checkbox" name="market" value="{{ m }}" {{ 'checked' if m in (selected_markets or ['CO']) else '' }}> {{ m }}</label>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
      <p class="hint">Solo se pueden analizar mercados que ya tengan datos investigados.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="row-3">
      <div>
        <label for="cost_price">Costo del producto</label>
        <input type="number" step="any" name="cost_price" id="cost_price" value="{{ form_values.cost_price if form_values else '' }}" placeholder="35000">
      </div>
      <div>
        <label for="target_price">Precio de venta objetivo</label>
        <input type="number" step="any" name="target_price" id="target_price" value="{{ form_values.target_price if form_values else '' }}" placeholder="89000">
      </div>
      <div>
        <label for="currency">Moneda</label>
        <input type="text" name="currency" id="currency" value="{{ form_values.currency if form_values else '' }}" placeholder="COP">
      </div>
    </div>

    <button type="submit">Analizar producto →</button>
  </form>
</main>
</body>
</html>
